3. For each (field, value) pair, look up the field's bit position and maximum allowed number:

   | Field | Bits | Max |
   |---|---|---|
   | EN | bit 0 | 1 |
   | MODE | bits 4–5 | 3 |
   | DIV | bits 8–19 | 4095 |
   | IRQ | bit 31 | 1 |

